      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation: chain 25."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work [tr, ch 1, tr] into the 6th ch from hook (first V-stitch). *Skip 2 ch, work [tr, ch 1, tr] into the next ch*. Repeat across. Tr into the last ch. Turn. (7 V-stitches.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 4 (counts as tr plus ch 1). *Work [tr, ch 1, tr] into the ch-1 space of the next V-stitch*. Repeat across. Tr into the turning chain. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Row 2 until the wrap measures 100 cm. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Picot edge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "With the right side facing, rejoin yarn at one corner of a long edge. *Sl st into the next st, ch 3, sl st into the same st*. Repeat along the full length of the edge. Fasten off. Repeat on the other long edge. Weave in ends. Wet block to finished dimensions."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
